# Ghostly Dancers: "return an enchantment card from your graveyard to your hand or unlock a locked door of a Room you control".
# On turn 5 Bot1 has an enchantment card in the graveyard (the first Unholy Annex // Ritual Chamber, destroyed by Disenchant) and a
# Room with a locked door (the second, cast as Unholy Annex), so both options are offered and Bot1 picks the door: Ritual Chamber is
# unlocked without paying (CR 709.5f), which triggers its "When you unlock this door, create a 6/6 black Demon creature token with
# flying" and, the Room being fully unlocked (CR 709.5i), Dancers' eerie: a 3/1 white Spirit creature token with flying. The
# enchantment card stays in the graveyard.

